^^ cycle i across s: visits every base, i = 0 .. len(s)-1.
gene nucleus()
    "ATGC" -> dna g
    cycle i across g
        report g@i
    stop

    ^^ s is evaluated once: shrinking g inside the loop still gives 4 passes
    "" -> dna seen
    cycle i across g
        fuse seen g@i -> seen
        tail(g) -> g
    stop
    report seen
    report g

    ^^ the loop holds a temporary sequence for its whole duration
    "AUGC" -> rna r
    cycle k across transcribe("TTA")
        report r@k
    stop
stop
